  "articleContent": "<div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\">Loading Data&gt;&gt;&gt;</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"1\" data-line=\"true\">✦Jingran✦</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"2\" data-line=\"true\">A Nethermancer from Mengzhou. An explorer wandering amid Mirage Realms and forgotten ruins. With his own eyes, he beholds the world's lingering echoes and the ancient traces it left behind.</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"3\" data-line=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"4\" data-line=\"true\">He follows no sect and bows to no doctrine, heeding neither gods nor decrees. Through Mirage Realms and shadowed lands he walks, judging right from wrong by his own heart alone, and in doing so, he has forged a path entirely his own.<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1788451200000/ixgz3fcfn7a97x88a3-1788505998125.jpg\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1788451200000/qjk9p4cw3zra4pqxfm-1788506033091.jpg\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"4\" data-line=\"true\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1788451200000/uimoa6l3cuwqqy7at1-1788505335537.gif\" width=\"800\" height=\"1295\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1788451200000/1v1wlgq5wq9n5g4v82-1788505353357.gif\" width=\"800\" height=\"1295\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1788451200000/tp7nlbuqwd1taynlv6-1788505420381.gif\" width=\"800\" height=\"1416\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1788451200000/enr8mch7vhu28d9rv5-1788505615115.gif\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1788451200000/1j2ey7s8wvipot8bgj-1788505497983.gif\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1788451200000/fzmi8mxibmqfkthfkg-1788505695754.gif\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1788451200000/kp2baxqsu9ok3kzqs8-1788505720460.gif\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1788451200000/zeqk8c35cnp1v6ovf4-1788505740375.jpg\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"></div>\n</div>",
